abstract: >-
  Scientific code and saved records for GPU-native execution of direct
  reinforcement-learning training in large-eddy simulation of wind-farm yaw
  control. Separately trained three-, nine- and 81-turbine cases provide
  reference-task checks, intermediate graph-policy evaluation, and farm-scale
  execution and control evidence. Author-generated data, trained actors and
  figures accompany original code under separate licences.
keywords:
  - wind-farm control
  - large-eddy simulation
  - reinforcement learning
  - JAX
  - GPU execution
